Assignment Title: Visual Studio 2.1: Exploring Medium Through Prompt Variation
Prompt: Create a dry-media artwork featuring a brother and sister. Using charcoal and pastel colors, blended smoothly to produce a soft, slick texture that resembles colored pencil work. The brother and sister should be the main focal point of the artwork. Using strong value contrast by making the figures brigther and more detailed than the background. Heavy on pastel tones and highlights should draw the viewer's attention directly to the siblingd, while the backround remains less detailed. Also use some vertical lines throughout the artwork to symbolize the strength, stability, and resilience. These lines can appear in the background such as in trees, buildings or other things. Add some movement that should communicate that the distractions of the world around them do not matter because they have each other. Also use charcoal cross-hatching to create deep shadows around the outer areas of the artwork. These shadows should symbolize lonlimess and the emotional darkness that could exist if the siblings did not have one another. 
